{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:12.74] Got a new .9 that'll leave your mouth wide\n[00:14.88] Leave you hogtied, burnin' on a campfire\n[00:17.68] Before I leave the crib, I pray to God I won't die\n[00:20.64] I know it's hard to kill me, but I know they gon' try\n[00:23.62] You's a pussy boy, yeah, you a feline\n[00:26.52] Get your own business and get out mine\n[00:29.42] Had to kill a witness, ain't doin' no time\n[00:32.34] Watch them niggas around you, they playin' both sides\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:35.32] Boy, your gang ain't your gang, and your homies not your homies\n[00:38.18] Run it up, get that sack, but do that shit right by your lonely\n[00:41.04] Choppa hit him with a force like I'm Obi-Wan Kenobi\n[00:43.84] Don't need no court to use my torch, I've been shootin' like I'm Kobe\n[00:46.80] I don't need nobody, I just need your body, ayy, ayy, ayy\n[00:49.70] I'm gon' catch a body if you fuck with my money, ayy, ayy, ayy\n[00:52.70] Mixin' them narcotics, turned me to a zombie\n[00:55.02] Ape with a nigga, Harambe\n[00:55.98] Pull up on a nigga, no talkin'\n[00:57.10] Leave a nigga leakin', no faucet, yeah\n[00:58.44] Stand up to the opps, never back down\n[00:59.72] He'll get beat with the belt like it's SmackDown\n[01:01.38] Studio, juug life, trap house, crack cocaine, my track outs\n[01:04.38] Up late night like owls, Backwoods, smokin' on White Owls\n[01:07.32] I got the lean on me right now, got a gun with a beam on me right now\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[01:10.70] Got a new 9 that'll leave your mouth wide\n[01:13.06] Leave you hogtied, burnin' on a campfire\n[01:15.86] Before I leave the crib, I pray to God I won't die\n[01:18.82] I know it's hard to kill me, but I know they gon' try\n[01:21.82] You's a pussy boy, yeah, you a feline\n[01:24.70] Get your own business and get out mine\n[01:27.60] Had to kill a witness, ain't doin' no time\n[01:30.52] Watch them niggas around you, they playin' both sides\n[Verse 2: Lil Yachty]\n[01:33.56] Had to cut some niggas off, started seein' signs\n[01:35.92] Switchin' sides, drop and die\n[01:37.44] Tellin' lies, niggas pie\n[01:39.32] I'm a swerve with it, keep that thing on Superman\n[01:42.16] Kissin' everybody babies, shakin' all the hands (Yeah)\n[01:45.14] Everything I once achieved came from a plant (Okay)\n[01:48.08] Had to do some bad things, bitch, I'm Dirty Dan\n[01:50.78] I came a long way from high school, poppin' Xans (Facts)\n[01:54.24] I'm a 20 year old king, I own a lot of land (Facts)\n[01:56.72] My momma boujee, she wouldn't dare drive in a Land Rover (Facts)\n[01:59.62] When I'm wrong, you gettin' shot like I'm Dan Fogler (Pew-pew-pew)\n[02:02.62] In the crib, Spike Lee drawin' on the poster (Yeah)\n[02:05.36] That's a throwback, she throw it back off the mimosa\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Lil Yachty]\n[02:09.34] Got a new 9 that'll leave your mouth wide (Lil Boat, gang)\n[02:11.26] Leave you hogtied, burnin' on a campfire (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:14.08] Before I leave the crib, I pray to God I won't die (Yeah)\n[02:17.02] I know it's hard to kill me, but I know they gon' try (Yeah)\n[02:19.82] You's a pussy boy, yeah, you a feline (Pussy)\n[02:22.90] Get your own business and get out mine (I'm so blessed)\n[02:26.00] Had to kill a witness, ain't doin' no time (Gang, gang, gang)\n[02:28.70] Watch them niggas around you, they playin' both sides (Juice)","words":[[12.0,12.34,"[Chorus:"],[12.4,12.6,"Juice"],[12.64,12.7,"WRLD]"],[12.74,12.88,"Got"],[12.92,12.92,"a"],[12.96,13.16,"new"],[13.18,13.2,".9"],[13.24,13.4,"that'll"],[13.44,13.52,"leave"],[13.56,13.74,"your"],[13.78,14.04,"mouth"],[14.14,14.48,"wide"],[14.88,15.0,"Leave"],[15.04,15.12,"you"],[15.22,15.92,"hogtied,"],[15.98,16.32,"burnin'"],[16.36,16.48,"on"],[16.54,16.54,"a"],[16.66,17.38,"campfire"],[17.68,17.92,"Before"],[18.08,18.08,"I"],[18.16,18.28,"leave"],[18.32,18.36,"the"],[18.44,18.68,"crib,"],[18.82,18.82,"I"],[18.86,19.02,"pray"],[19.08,19.12,"t